{"n": 973, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "973.webp", "text": "51-360\n\n§136050 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nLEFT OR RIGHT REAR SIDE\nWINDOW\n\nRemove rear side trim panel, see 51 43 000.\nLift off C pillar plate.\n\nLoosen screw.\n\nRemove clotheshook.\n\nLoosen screw.\n\nLift off cover.\nLoosen screw.\n\nLift out rubber frame, beginning at a corner,\nand press out window glass.\n\nCaution!\n\nPrevent window glass from falling down,\n\nJnstallation\n\nCoat rubber frame with a lubricating solution”.\n\nPress on window glass and pull in rubber\nframe all around with Special Tool 51 3 057\nand a plastic spatula,\n\n* See Specifications\n\n5136071 REPLACING LEFT OR RIGHT\nREAR SIDE WINDOW\n\nRemove window, see 51 36 050\nApply Special Tool 51 3 000 in toolbox\nMount window glass.\n\nLift out ornamental strips.\nPull off rubber frame.\n\nfastallation:\n\nCheck rubber frame, replacing if necessary\nInsert ornamental strips, beginning at upper\nedge of window.\n\nIf necessary, coat rubber frame with 2\nlubricating solution* .\n\nNote;\nIf window had been broken, clean seat belt\nreel to remove glass splitters.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["51-360", 0.459, 0.0279, 0.5309, 0.0537], ["§136050", 0.2629, 0.063, 0.3126, 0.0743], ["REMOVING", 0.3257, 0.0637, 0.386, 0.0749], ["AND", 0.3901, 0.0637, 0.4139, 0.0743], ["INSTALLING", 0.4179, 0.0637, 0.4858, 0.0749], ["LEFT", 0.3257, 0.0796, 0.3531, 0.0902], ["OR", 0.3566, 0.0796, 0.3723, 0.0902], ["RIGHT", 0.3769, 0.0796, 0.4113, 0.0908], ["REAR", 0.4159, 0.0796, 0.4463, 0.0908], ["SIDE", 0.4498, 0.0796, 0.4752, 0.0908], ["WINDOW", 0.3247, 0.0955, 0.3718, 0.1061], ["Remove", 0.2634, 0.1273, 0.3019, 0.1386], ["rear", 0.305, 0.13, 0.3232, 0.1386], ["side", 0.3273, 0.1273, 0.3455, 0.1386], ["trim", 0.3485, 0.13, 0.3688, 0.1386], ["panel,", 0.3723, 0.128, 0.4002, 0.1412], ["see", 0.4037, 0.1306, 0.4179, 0.1393], ["51", 0.4215, 0.1273, 0.4321, 0.1393], ["43", 0.4362, 0.128, 0.4488, 0.1393], ["000.", 0.4519, 0.128, 0.4732, 0.1393], ["Lif